            "\\((a - 3)(4x - 5)\\)",
            "\\((4x - 3)(a - 5)\\)",
            "\\((a + 3)(4x - 5)\\)",
            "\\((4a - 5)(x - 3)\\)"
          ],
          "answer": 0,
          "hint": "Factorise by grouping. Group the first two terms and the last two terms.",
          "steps": [
            {
              "explain": "Group the terms in pairs.",
              "work": "\\((4ax - 12x) - (5a - 15)\\)"
            },
            {
              "explain": "Take out the common factor in each pair.",
              "work": "\\(4x(a - 3) - 5(a - 3)\\)"
            },
            {
              "explain": "Factor out the common binomial bracket \\((a - 3)\\).",
              "work": "\\((a - 3)(4x - 5)\\)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "y9-ep1-alg-quad-2d",
          "type": "mc",
          "stem": "Factorise the following:<br><br>\\(2x^2 + 13x - 7\\)",
          "options": [
            "\\((2x - 1)(x + 7)\\)",
            "\\((2x + 1)(x - 7)\\)",
            "\\((2x - 7)(x + 1)\\)",
            "\\((x - 1)(2x + 7)\\)"
          ],
          "answer": 0,
          "hint": "This is a non-monic quadratic. You can use the cross-method or grouping (splitting the middle term).",
          "steps": [
            {
              "explain": "Multiply the coefficient of \\(x^2\\) (which is 2) by the constant term (-7).",
              "work": "\\(2 \\times -7 = -14\\)"
            },
            {
              "explain": "Find two numbers that multiply to \\(-14\\) and add to the middle coefficient (13).",
              "work": "The numbers are 14 and -1."
            },
            {
              "explain": "Split the middle term \\(13x\\) using these numbers.",
              "work": "\\(2x^2 + 14x - 1x - 7\\)"
            },
            {
              "explain": "Factorise by grouping.",
              "work": "\\(2x(x + 7) - 1(x + 7)\\)"
            },
            {
              "explain": "Factor out the common binomial.",
              "work": "\\((2x - 1)(x + 7)\\)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "y9-ep1-alg-quad-3a",
          "type": "mc",
          "stem": "Simplify:<br><br>\\(\\frac{2x + 1}{5} - \\frac{x - 2}{3}\\)",
